Package: cfTREBLE
Type: Package
Title: Tree-Based Bayesian Cell-Type Deconvolution of Cell-Free DNA Methylation
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Yucheng", "Wang", email = "ychwang0331@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A complete, resumable pipeline for cf-TREBLE: hierarchical
    cell-type tree construction, per-node marginal likelihoods over whole-genome
    bisulfite reference panels, EM for the Bernoulli and categorical priors on
    the tree, marker CpG selection, subject-specific signature estimation, and
    deconvolution of cell-free DNA methylation samples. Designed to run as a
    SLURM job array on a cluster, driven by a single configuration file.
URL: https://github.com/yuchengwang-stat/cfTREBLE
BugReports: https://github.com/yuchengwang-stat/cfTREBLE/issues
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
